      "statement": "pay_wire_txn_hist is a TDIP Payments-domain dataset sourced hourly via change-data-capture (CDC) from PRISM Payments Hub (PPH), retains 7 years of history, is classified Confidential - Client, and is owned by Laura Kim / Carlos Mendes.",
