    },
    {
      "id": "claim_036b96e9ecad4ebe9b2cffa659c63564",
      "statement": "pay_wire_txn_hist carries PPH's own internal processing/state-transition timestamps rather than the Federal Reserve's authoritative Fedwire acceptance timestamp, so domestic (Fedwire) settlement-time analytics cannot be computed from it alone and require the not-yet-ingested fed_ack_events dataset (backlog item TDA-2210).",
