    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6b1c90646bd64834a4fe0805a86a1bbc",
      "statement": "pay_wire_txn_hist is a direct input to all three Payments-domain TDIP feature tables: wire_corridor_stats_daily (joined with gpi_tracker_events across all originating clients), beneficiary_behavior_profile (joined with dda_txn_history on incoming wires to CNB accounts), and client_wire_history_features (joined with gpi_tracker_events at client x beneficiary grain).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/tdip-cat-2026.2-treasury-data-and-insights-platform-data-catalog-extract.md#L41-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2082afba3708689b0dd9e8cc06eec2f17b36425ffb27d4c65d970fba22e7b421:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8c43da7bc679430ca7d3f40e1d9a3a15",
      "statement": "Feature tables derived from pay_wire_txn_hist do not inherit its Confidential - Client classification uniformly: beneficiary_behavior_profile is elevated to Restricted - Client Confidential because that is the floor set by its more-sensitive input dda_txn_history, while wire_corridor_stats_daily is lowered to Internal because its output is cross-client cohort aggregation with no single-client attribution.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/tdip-cat-2026.2-treasury-data-and-insights-platform-data-catalog-extract.md#L41-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2082afba3708689b0dd9e8cc06eec2f17b36425ffb27d4c65d970fba22e7b421:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_db1aedfbd2e84d078659972ec32cfb2c",
      "statement": "Wherever pay_wire_txn_hist is joined with gpi_tracker_events to build a feature table, the resulting table's freshness and historical depth are bounded by gpi_tracker_events (nightly refresh until TDA-2188 completes; history only from 2025-03-01) rather than by pay_wire_txn_hist's own hourly cadence and 7-year retention.",
      "evidence": [
